Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Duo: recommended apps installer after the setup wizard

After setup completes (USER_SETUP_COMPLETE) a notification offers a checklist of the apps the stock Surface
Duo shipped, plus YouTube and Google Wallet. Each tap opens one app's Play Store page; a GSI cannot install
from Play silently. Also reachable from DUO-DE Settings > Recommended apps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
